BT /F1 9.6 Tf 50.0 103.4 Td (  win. Keep this list focused on operations that are dangerous regardless of context. Important) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 50.0 90.8 Td (  caveat: permission rules have had documented bypass classes - Adversa AI Red Team disclosed a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 50.0 78.2 Td (  parser-cap bypass in April 2026 \(patched in v2.1.90\); eve.gd documented arbitrary-subprocess) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 50.0 65.6 Td (  and chained-shell bypass classes the same month. Treat the deny list as defense-in-depth. The) Tj ET
