BT /F1 9.6 Tf 50.0 743.6 Td (  approval. Use for compliance, audit, or high-blast-radius operations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 62.0 731.0 Td (- sandbox.enabled: true + failIfUnavailable: true - if the OS can't sandbox \(e.g. unsupported) Tj ET
